config BR2_PACKAGE_X6X00_MODEM
	bool "x6x00-modem"
	help
	  One end of a modem link between two radios: BinModem's fax
	  modems ported to C (V.21, V.27 ter, V.29) and T.30's
	  procedure, over the radio's own TCI server. Driven from a
	  computer (tools/bench/bench.py radios-modem); it transmits
	  only while that computer says the other radio is off the
	  air. Installed as /usr/bin/x6x00-modem; its source is this
	  repository's tools/modem (GPL-3.0-or-later, as BinModem).
